  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> The sling bullet smashes into your left side, some of your floating ribs gaining hairline fractures as they flex under the impact. The blow bursts your spleen, causing heavy internal bleeding!</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Bleeding] (1) which can only be removed through magical healing.* Surgery or ordinary Heal Tests don’t work as the bleeding is inside the fibrous capsule surrounding the spleen, impossible to get at. Fortunately, the capsule also contains the bleeding, which will stop after 1d10+5 turns, causing the @Condition[Bleeding] Condition to be removed. \n Because the spleen is an important part of your immune system you’ll lose any Resistance (Disease) Talent that you had.</p>"
    },
